<title>USA: Telepad talks with Federal Computer to continue.</title>
<headline>Telepad talks with Federal Computer to continue.</headline>
<dateline>HERNDON, Va. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>TelePad Corp said Thursday that privately held Federal Computer Corp has agreed to continue discussions, at least through August 31, over TelePad's proposal to acquire the company.</p>
<p>TelePad announced on January 28 that it had signed a definitive agreement to acquire Federal subject to financing obligations.  The agreement will expire August 1, Telepad said.</p>
